# Execution Mode

Ali stops the conversation if asked too many clarifying questions before starting. He treats the agent as the implementer and dictates answers in plain text when discovery feels like stalling.

## Why

Long discovery phases feel like the agent is stalling. He'd rather see TodoWrite + actual files/code than another question form.

## How to apply

- On open-ended "build me X" requests from Ali, do **at most ONE small confirmation question** if truly blocked.
- Otherwise pick reasonable defaults, state them in one short sentence, and start executing.
- Make progress visible via TodoWrite + actual files/code, not via more questions.
- If the request is concrete (a file path, a specific task), skip the question entirely.

## See also

- [`engineering-standards`](engineering-standards.mdc) — direct execution does NOT mean cutting corners on quality.
